Upstream tag:        v12.4.0
Upstream commit:     2ad0b8672f68a48148620164510b963039e49eb1

Local modifications:

  - Removed include/module.modulemap (Swift-only; unused in this C build).
  - Removed src/rc_libretro.{c,h} (libretro frontend; we talk to rcheevos
    directly, not through the libretro adapter).
  - Removed src/rc_client_raintegration.{c,h} and
    src/rc_client_raintegration_internal.h (RAIntegration DLL adapter; we
    use the higher-level rc_client HTTP API directly).
  - Removed include/rc_client_raintegration.h (matches the .c/.h removal
    above).
  - Removed src/rc_client_types.natvis and
    src/rcheevos/rc_runtime_types.natvis (Visual Studio debugger visualizers;
    we do not build under the Visual Studio debugger).

The trimmed sources compile unchanged under CMake + GCC / Clang / MSVC.
To refresh from upstream: drop a fresh rcheevos v12.4.0 checkout in place and
re-apply the removals above. To upgrade to a newer rcheevos release, re-vendor
under a new directory name (e.g. native/rcheevos-v12.5.0/) and update
native/CMakeLists.txt + the SHA recorded above; do not mutate the upstream
sources in place.
